Detector.description:
There are two types of usage:
 * detector is a generic container for hw systems and objects;
 * sub-detector as defined by event format and referenced by ROS or RCD

FastTestMode.description:
Allows to control whether event data should go
to the output stage (for experts). 
Possible values: 
0 - all events to output (default); 
1 - no events to output; 
>= 2 - 1% of events to output.

PatchArea.description:
